            "level": {
              "value": 4
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You adapt a creature to live among the trees, improving its ability to climb, balance, and leap. Target a willing creature within 30 feet. For 10 minutes, it gains a climb Speed equal to its Speed and a +1 circumstance bonus to Acrobatics checks to Balance and Athletics checks to Long Jump and High Jump. When it Leaps, it increases the distance it can Leap horizontally by 5 feet and vertically by 2 feet. If you use Born to the Trees again, any existing one ends."
            }
          }
        }
